<title>UK: DSL Finance sets 2.0 billion French franc bond.</title>
<headline>DSL Finance sets 2.0 billion French franc bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Credit Agricole and Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DSL FINANCE NV</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN FFR   COUPON     5.75	MATURITY    15.SEP.09</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.133   PAY DATE    15.SEP.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 REOFFER    99.483    SPREAD	+13 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX/PAR   PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND INTERPOLATED 8.5 PCT 2008 AND 6.5 PCT 2011</p>
<p>			    OATS</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
